{
  "type": "cd4017",
  "name": "CD4017 decade counter with 10 outputs",
  "category": "Logic chips (DIP)",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Johnson decade counter (DIP-16): one of Q0-Q9 is high, the next at each rising edge of CP0 while CP1 is low (or falling CP1 while CP0 is high); MR high returns to Q0; CO is high for counts 0-4; VDD 3 to 15 V; runs as a digital chip: with a board or on its own, inputs from the rest of the circuit arrive up to 0.1 ms late (clocks up to a few kHz)",
